2. While maintaining the torse stationary (no swinging), lift the haltères to your side with a slight bend on the coude and the hands slightly tilted forward as if pouring water in a glass. Continue to go up until you arms are parallèle au sol. Expirez as you execute this movement and pause for a second at the top.
3. Lower the haltères back down Lentement, to the position de départ as you inspirez.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Seated_Side_Lateral_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Seated Triceps Press', 'Triceps', 'Haltères', '1. Asseyez-vous sur un banc with back support and grasp a haltère with both hands and hold it overhead at arm''s length. Conseil : a better way is to have somebody hand it to you especially if it is very heavy. The resistance should be resting in the palms of vos mains with your thumbs around it. The palm of the hand should be facing inward. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Keeping your upper arms close to votre tête (coudes in) and perpendiculaire à le sol, lower the resistance in a semi-circular motion behind votre tête until your forearms touch your biceps. Conseil : The upper arms should remain stationary and only the forearms should move. Inspirez as you perform this step.
3. Go back to the position de départ by using the triceps to raise the haltère. Expirez as you perform this step.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Seated_Triceps_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Seated Two-Arm Palms-Up Low-Pulley Wrist Curl', 'Avant-bras', 'Poulie', '1. Put a banc in front of a low pulley machine that has a barre or EZ Curl attachment on it.
2. Move the banc far enough away so that when you bring the handle to the top of your cuisses tension is created on the cable due to the poids stack being moved up.
3. Now hold the handle with both hands, palms up, using a épaule-width grip.
4. Step back and sit on the banc with vos pieds about épaule width apart, firmly on le sol.
5. Lean forward and place the forearms on your cuisses with the back of your poignets over your genous. C''est votre position de départ.
6. Lower the bar as far as possible, while inhaling and keeping a tight grip.
7. Now curl the bar up as high as possible while contracting the forearms. Conseil : Only the poignet should move; not the forearms.
8. After a second contraction at the top go back to the position de départ as you inspirez.
9. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Seated_Two-Arm_Palms-Up_Low-Pulley_Wrist_Curl/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('See-Saw Press (Alternating Side Press)', 'Épaules', 'Haltères', '1. Grab a haltère with each hand and Levez-vous erect.
2. Clean (lift) the haltères to the poitrine/épaule level and then rotate your poignets so that your palms are facing towards you as if you were getting ready to perform an Arnold Press. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Now start extending your left arm overhead as you rotate the poignet so that the palm of your hand faces forward as you go up. Your coudes should come out also as you lift the poids. Simultaneously, you will also be bending from your hanche to your opposite side. Conseil : If you perform the exercise correctly, is should look as if you are trying to reach for something overhead on the right hand side of votre corps, but with your left arm. Expirez as you perform this movement.
4. Once you reach the top position Inspirez. Then, with the poids fully extended overhead and you bent over to your right hand side, begin le mouvement to the left side.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abdominaux, Triceps. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/See-Saw_Press_Alternating_Side_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Shotgun Row', 'Dos', 'Poulie', '1. Attach a single handle to a low cable.
2. After selecting the correct poids, stand a couple feet back with a wide-split stance. Your arm should be extended and your épaule forward. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Perform le mouvement by retracting the épaule and flexing the coude. As you pull, supinate the poignet, turning the palm upward as you go.
4. Après une pause, Revenez en position de départ.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Milieu du dos. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Shotgun_Row/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Shoulder Circles', 'Épaules', 'Autre', '1. With épaules relaxed and arms resting loosely at your sides (or in your lap if you''re seated), gently roll your épaules forward, up, back, and down.
2. Reverse direction. You can do cet exercice alternating épaules or both at the same time.', 'Muscles secondaires : Trapèzes. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Shoulder_Circles/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Shoulder Press - With Bands', 'Épaules', 'Élastique', '1. To begin, stand on an exercise band so that tension begins at arm''s length. Grasp the handles and lift them so that the hands are at épaule height at each side.
2. Rotate the poignets so that the palms of vos mains are facing forward. Your coudes should be bent, with the upper arms and forearms in line to the torse. C''est votre position de départ.
3. As you expirez, lift the handles up until vos bras are fully extended overhead.', 'Muscles secondaires : Triceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Shoulder_Press_-_With_Bands/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Shoulder Raise', 'Épaules', 'Autre', '1. Relax vos bras to your sides and raise your épaules up toward your ears, then back down.', 'Muscles secondaires : Dos. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Shoulder_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Shoulder Stretch', 'Épaules', 'Autre', '1. Reach your left arm across votre corps and hold it straight.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Shoulder_Stretch/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side-Lying Floor Stretch', 'Dos', 'Autre', '1. First lie on your left side, bending your left genou in front of you to stabilize your torse (use your abdominal muscles as well to hold you upright).
2. Straighten your right leg and rest the right foot on le sol behind your left. Straighten your right arm over votre tête and gently pull on your right poignet to stretch the entire right side of the body. Switch sides.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side-Lying_Floor_Stretch/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Bridge', 'Abdominaux', 'Poids de corps', '', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Bridge/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Hop-Sprint', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Stand to the side of a cone or hurdle.
2. Begin this drill by hopping sideways over the obstacle, rebounding out of your landing to hop back to where you started.
3. Hop for a prescribed number or repetitions as quickly as possible, and finish this drill by sprinting a short distance upon landing the last hop.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs, Adducteurs, Mollets, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Hop-Sprint/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Jackknife', 'Abdominaux', 'Poids de corps', '', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Jackknife/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Lateral Raise', 'Épaules', 'Haltères', '1. Pick a couple of haltères and Tenez-vous debout avec a straight torse and the haltères by your side bras tendus with the palms of the hand facing you. C''est votre position de départ.
2. While maintaining the torse in a stationary position (no swinging), lift the haltères to your side with a slight bend on the coude and the hands slightly tilted forward as if pouring water in a glass. Continue to go up until you arms are parallèle au sol. Expirez as you execute this movement and pause for a second at the top.
3. Lower the haltères back down Lentement, to the position de départ as you inspirez.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Lateral_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Laterals to Front Raise', 'Épaules', 'Haltères', '1. In a standing position, hold a pair of haltères at your side. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Keeping your coudes slightly bent, raise the poids directly in front of you to épaule height, avoiding any swinging or cheating.
3. At the top of the exercise move the poids out in front of you, keeping vos bras extended.
4. Lower the poids with a controlled motion.
5. On the next repetition, raise the poids in front of you to épaule height before moving the poids laterally to your sides.
6. Lower the poids to the position de départ.', 'Muscles secondaires : Trapèzes. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Laterals_to_Front_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Leg Raises', 'Adducteurs', 'Poids de corps', '1. Stand next to a chair, which you may hold onto as a support. Stand on one leg. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Keeping your leg straight, raise it as far out to the side as possible, and swing it back down, allowing it to cross the opposite leg.
3. Répétez this swinging motion 5-10 times, increasing the range of motion as you do so.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Leg_Raises/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Lying Groin Stretch', 'Adducteurs', 'Autre', '1. Start off by lying on your right side and bend your right genou in front of you to stabilize the torse.
2. Rest votre tête on your right hand or épaule. Lift your left leg upward and hold it by the back of the genou (easier) or the foot (harder).
3. Pull your left genou in toward your left épaule and simultaneously press your foot or genou down to le sol. To intensify this stretch, straighten your left leg. Switch sides.', 'Muscles secondaires : Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Lying_Groin_Stretch/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Neck Stretch', 'Cou', 'Autre', '1. Start with your épaules relaxed, gently tilt votre tête towards your épaule.
2. Assist stretch with a gentle pull on the side of the head.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Neck_Stretch/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Standing Long Jump', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Begin standing with vos pieds hanche width apart in an athletic stance. votre tête and poitrine should be up, genous and hanches slightly bent. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Leaning to your right, extend through your hanches, genous, and chevilles to jump into the air. Block with the arms to lead le mouvement, jumping as far to your right as you can.
3. Land facing the same direction with vos pieds hanche width apart, absorbing the impact through your lower body.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Standing_Long_Jump/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side To Side Chins', 'Dos', 'Autre', '1. Grab the pull-up bar with the paumes vers l''avant using a prise large.
2. As you have both arms extended in front of you holding the bar at a prise large, bring your torse back around 30 degrees or so while creating a curvature on your lower back and sticking your poitrine out. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Pull your torse up while leaning to the left hand side until the bar almost touches your upper poitrine by drawing the épaules and the upper arms down and back. Expirez as you perform this portion of le mouvement. Conseil : Concentrate on squeezing the back muscles once you reach the full contracted position. The upper torse should remain stationary as it moves through space (no swinging) and only the arms should move. The forearms should do no other work other than hold the bar.
4. After a second of contraction, inspirez as you go back to the position de départ.
5. Now, pull your torse up while leaning to the right hand side until the bar almost touches your upper poitrine by drawing the épaules and the upper arms down and back. Expirez as you perform this portion of le mouvement. Conseil : Concentrate on squeezing the back muscles once you reach the full contracted position. The upper torse should remain stationary as it moves through space and only the arms should move. The forearms should do no other work other than hold the bar.
6. After a second of contraction, inspirez as you go back to the position de départ.
7. Répétez steps 3-6 until you have performed the prescribed amount of repetitions for each side.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Avant-bras, Milieu du dos, Épaules. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_To_Side_Chins/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side Wrist Pull', 'Épaules', 'Autre', '1. This stretch works best standing. Cross your left arm over the midline of votre corps and hold the left poignet in your right hand down at the level of your hanches. Start the stretch with a bent left arm.
2. Lentement, straighten, pull, and lift it up to épaule height, as pictured. Feel this stretch originate in votre dos, not your épaules, and don''t pull too hard on the épaules joint. Switch sides.', 'Muscles secondaires : Avant-bras, Dos. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_Wrist_Pull/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Side to Side Box Shuffle', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Stand to one side of the box with your left foot resting on the middle of it.
2. To begin, jump up and over to the other side of the box, landing with your right foot on top of the box and your left foot on le sol. Swing vos bras to aid your movement.
3. Continue shuffling back and forth across the box.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs, Adducteurs, Mollets, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Side_to_Side_Box_Shuffle/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Arm Cable Crossover', 'Pectoraux', 'Poulie', '1. Begin by moving the pulleys to the high position, select the resistance to be used, and take a handle in each hand.
2. Step forward in front of both pulleys with vos bras extended in front of you, bringing vos mains together. votre tête and poitrine should be up as you lean forward, while vos pieds should be staggered. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Keeping your left arm in place, allow your right arm to extend out to the side, maintaining a slight bend at the coude. The right arm should be perpendiculaire à the body at approximately épaule level.
4. Return your arm back to the position de départ by pulling your hand back to the midline of the body.
5. Maintenez la position 1 seconde at the position de départ and Répétez le mouvement on the opposite side. Continue alternating back and forth for the prescribed number of repetitions.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Arm_Cable_Crossover/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Arm Linear Jammer', 'Épaules', 'Barre', '1. Position a bar into a landmine or securely anchor it in a corner. Load the bar to an appropriate poids.
2. Raise the bar from le sol, taking it to your épaules with one or both hands. Adopt a wide stance. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Perform le mouvement by extending the coude, pressing the poids up. Move explosively, extending the hanches and genous fully to produce maximal force.
4. Revenez en position de départ.', 'Muscles secondaires : Pectoraux, Triceps. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Arm_Linear_Jammer/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Arm Push-Up', 'Pectoraux', 'Poids de corps', '1. Begin laying prone on the ground. Move yourself into a position supporting your poids on your toes and one arm. Your working arm should be placed directly under the épaule, fully extended. vos jambes should be extended, and for this movement you may need a wider base, placing vos pieds further apart than in a normal push-up.
2. Maintain good posture, and place your free hand behind votre dos. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Lower yourself by allowing the coude to flex until you touch the ground.
4. Descend slowly, and reverse direction be extending the arm to Revenez en position de départ.', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules, Triceps. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Arm_Push-Up/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Cone Sprint Drill', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. This drill teaches quick foot action. You need a single cone. Begin standing next to the cone with one arm back and one arm forward.
2. Chop the feet as quickly as possible, blocking with the arms. Circle the cone, keep your genous up, with violent foot action.
3. Rest after three trips around the cone.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Cone_Sprint_Drill/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Leg High Box Squat', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Position a box in a rack. Secure a band or rope in place above the box.
2. Standing in front of it, step onto the box to a full standing position, letting your other leg remain unsupported. Hold onto the band for balance
3. . Continue stepping up and down on the same leg before switching to the opposite side.', 'Muscles secondaires : Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Leg_High_Box_Squat/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Leg Hop Progression', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Arrange a line of cones in front of you. Assume a relaxed standing position, balanced on one leg. Raise the genou of your opposite leg. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Hop forward, jumping and landing with the same leg over the cone.
3. Use a countermovement jump to hop from cone to cone.
4. At the end, turn around and go back on the other leg.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs, Adducteurs, Mollets, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Leg_Hop_Progression/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Leg Lateral Hop', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Stand to the side of a cone or hurdle. To get into the start position, stand on one leg with your genou slightly bent.
2. To begin, execute a counterjump to hop sideways over the cone.
3. Land on your jumping leg, and immediately rebound out of it by jumping back to the start position.
4. Continue hopping back and forth.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs, Adducteurs, Mollets, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Leg_Lateral_Hop/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Leg Leg Extension', 'Quadriceps', 'Machine', '1. Seat yourself in the machine and adjust it so that you are positioned properly. The pad should be against the lower part of the shin but not in contact with the cheville. Adjust the seat so that the pivot point is in line with your genou. Select a poids appropriate for your abilities.
2. Maintaining good posture, fully extend one leg, pausing at the top of the motion.
3. Revenez en position de départ without letting the poids stop, keeping tension on the muscle.
4. Répétez for the desired number of repetitions.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Leg_Leg_Extension/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single-Leg Stride Jump', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Stand to the side of a box with your inside foot on top of it, close to the edge.
2. Begin by swinging the arms upward as you push through the top leg, jumping upward as high as possible. Attempt to drive the opposite genou upward.
3. Land in the same position that you started, using your inside leg to decelerate the impact.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs, Adducteurs, Mollets, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single-Leg_Stride_Jump/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single Dumbbell Raise', 'Épaules', 'Haltères', '1. With a wide stance, hold a dumbell with both hands, grasping the head of the haltère instead of the handle. vos bras should be extended and hanging at the waist. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Raise the poids until it is above épaule level, keeping vos bras extended. Your torse and hanches should remain stationary throughout le mouvement.
3. Revenez en position de départ and Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Avant-bras, Trapèzes. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single_Dumbbell_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single Leg Butt Kick', 'Quadriceps', 'Poids de corps', '1. Begin by standing on one leg, with the bent genou raised. This will be your start position.
2. Using a countermovement jump, take off upward by extending the hanche, genou, and cheville of the grounded leg.
3. Immediately flex the genou and attempt to touch your butt with the heel of your jumping leg.
4. Return the leg to a partially bent position underneath the hanches and land. Your opposite leg should stay in relatively the same position throughout the drill.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single_Leg_Butt_Kick/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single Leg Glute Bridge', 'Fessiers', 'Poids de corps', '1. Lay on le sol with vos pieds flat and genous bent.
2. Raise one leg off of the ground, pulling the genou to your poitrine. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Execute le mouvement by driving through the heel, extending your hanche upward and raising your fessiers off of the ground.
4. Extend as far as possible, pause and then Revenez en position de départ.', 'Muscles secondaires : Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single_Leg_Glute_Bridge/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Single Leg Push-off', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Stand on the ground with one foot resting on the box, heel close to the edge.
2. Push off with your foot on top of the box, trying to gain as much height as possible by extending through the hanche and genou.
3. Land with the same foot on top of the box, returning your other foot back to the start position.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Single_Leg_Push-off/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sit-Up', 'Abdominaux', 'Poids de corps', '1. Allongez-vous au sol placing vos pieds either under something that will not move or by having a partner hold them. vos jambes should be bent at the genous.
2. Place vos mains behind votre tête and lock them together by clasping your fingers. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Elevate your upper body so that it creates an imaginary V-shape with your cuisses. Expirez when performing this part of the exercise.
4. Once you feel the contraction for a second, lower your upper body back down to the position de départ while inhaling.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sit-Up/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sit Squats', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Tenez-vous debout avec vos pieds épaule width apart. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Begin le mouvement by flexing your genous and hanches, sitting back with your hanches.
3. Continue until you have squatted a portion of the way down, but are above parallel, and quickly reverse the motion until you Revenez en position de départ. Répétez for 5-10 repetitions.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sit_Squats/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Skating', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Roller skating is a fun activity which can be effective in improving cardiorespiratory fitness and muscular endurance. It requires relatively good balance and coordination. It is necessary to learn the basics of skating including turning and stopping and to wear protective gear to avoid possible injury.
2. You can skate at a comfortable pace for 30 minutes straight. If you want a cardio challenge, do interval skating — speed skate two minutes of every five minutes, using the remaining three minutes to recover. A 150 lb person will typically burn about 175 calories in 30 minutes skating at a comfortable pace, similar to brisk walking.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs, Adducteurs, Mollets, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Skating/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sled Drag - Harness', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. To begin, load the sled with the desired poids and attach the pulling strap. You can pull with handles, use a harness, or attach the pulling strap to a poids belt.
2. Whether pulling forwards or backwards, lean in the direction of travel and progress by extending through the hanches and genous.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sled_Drag_-_Harness/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sled Overhead Backward Walk', 'Épaules', 'Autre', '1. Attach dual handles to a sled connected by a rope or chain. Load the sled to a light poids.
2. Face the sled, backing up until there is some tension in the line. Hold vos mains directly above votre tête with your coudes extended. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Walk backwards, keeping vos bras raised above votre tête. Avoid jerky movements.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Milieu du dos, Quadriceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sled_Overhead_Backward_Walk/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sled Overhead Triceps Extension', 'Triceps', 'Autre', '1. Attach dual handles to a sled using a chain or rope. Load the sled to an appropriate load.
2. Facing away from the sled, step away until there is tension in the line. Raise vos mains above votre tête, keeping them together, paumes vers each other. Your coudes should be pointed upward with the coudes flexed. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Extend through the coude to straighten the arm. Ensure that your upper arm stays in position to isolate the triceps.
4. Upon full extension, step forward to take the slack out of the line. You may keep vos pieds staggered for more stability.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sled_Overhead_Triceps_Extension/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sled Push', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Load your pushing sled with the desired poids.
2. Take an athletic posture, leaning into the sled with vos bras fully extended, grasping the handles. Push the sled as fast as possible, focusing on extending your hanches and genous to strengthen your posterior chain.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Pectoraux, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers, Triceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sled_Push/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sled Reverse Flye', 'Épaules', 'Autre', '1. Attach dual handles to a sled connected by a rope or chain. Load the sled to a light poids.
2. Face the sled, backing up until there is some tension in the line. Take both handles bras tendus at about waist level. Bend the genous slightly and keep your poitrine and head up. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Without flexing the coude, pull the handles upward and apart, performing a reverse fly with some external rotation. Your palms should be facing forward as you do this.
4. Revenez en position de départ, taking a couple steps back to take the slack out of the line.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sled_Reverse_Flye/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sled Row', 'Milieu du dos', 'Autre', '1. Attach dual handles to a sled connected by a rope or chain. Load the sled to an appropriate poids. Face the sled, backing up until there is some tension in the line.
2. With a handle in each hand, bend the genous slightly, keep votre tête and poitrine up, and begin with vos bras extended.
3. To initiate le mouvement, flex the coude as you retract your omoplates, pulling the sled towards you.
4. Take a step or two back to get tension in the line and Répétez.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Dos. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sled_Row/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Sledgehammer Swings', 'Abdominaux', 'Autre', '1. You will need a tire and a sledgehammer for cet exercice. Stand in front of the tire about two feet away from it with a staggered stance. Grip the sledgehammer.
2. If you are right handed, your left hand should be at the bottom of the handle, and your right hand should be choking up closer to the head.
3. As you bring the sledge up, your right hand slides toward the head; as you swing down, your right hand will slide down to join your left hand. Slam it down as hard as you can against the tire. Control the bounce of the hammer off of the tire.
4. Répétez de l''autre côté.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Avant-bras, Dos, Milieu du dos, Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Sledgehammer_Swings/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Incline Shoulder Raise', 'Épaules', 'Barre', '1. Place an incline banc underneath the smith machine. Place the barre at a height that you can reach when lying down and vos bras are almost fully extended. Once the poids you need is selected, Allongez-vous sur un banc incliné and make sure your épaules are aligned right under the barre.
2. Using a épaule width pronated (palms forward) grip, lift the bar from the rack and hold it straight over you with a slight bend at the coudes. C''est votre position de départ.
3. As you Expirez, lift the bar up until vos bras are fully extended. Note: The contraction should be felt around the épaules.
4. Après une pause, bring the bar back down to the position de départ as you Inspirez.
5. Répétez le mouvement for the prescribed amount of repetitions.
6. When you are done, place the bar back in the rack.', 'Muscles secondaires : Pectoraux. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Incline_Shoulder_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Behind the Back Shrug', 'Trapèzes', 'Machine', '1. With the bar at cuisse level, load an appropriate poids.
2. Tenez-vous debout avec the bar behind you, taking a épaule-width, pronated grip on the bar and unhook the poids. You should be standing up straight with votre tête and poitrine up and vos bras extended. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Initiate le mouvement by shrugging your épaules straight up. Do not flex the arms or poignet during le mouvement.
4. Après une pause, return the poids to the position de départ.
5. Répétez for the desired number of repetitions before engaging the hooks to rack the poids.', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Behind_the_Back_Shrug/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Bench Press', 'Pectoraux', 'Machine', '1. Place a flat banc underneath the smith machine. Now place the barre at a height that you can reach when lying down and vos bras are almost fully extended. Once the poids you need is selected, Allongez-vous sur un banc plat. Using a pronated grip that is wider than épaule width, unlock the bar from the rack and hold it straight over you with vos bras locked. C''est votre position de départ.
2. As you Inspirez, come down Lentement, until you feel the bar on your middle poitrine.
3. Après une pause, bring the bar back to the position de départ as you Expirez and push the bar using your poitrine muscles. Lock vos bras in the contracted position, Maintenez la position 1 seconde and then start coming down Lentement, again. Conseil : It should take at least twice as long to go down than to come up.
4. Répétez le mouvement for the prescribed amount of repetitions.
5. When you are done, lock the bar back in the rack.', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules, Triceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Bench_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Bent Over Row', 'Milieu du dos', 'Machine', '1. Set the barre attached to the smith machine to a height that is about 2 inches below your genous.
2. Bend your genous slightly and bring your torse forward, by bending at the waist, while keeping the back straight until it is almost parallèle au sol. Conseil : Make sure that you keep the head up.
3. Now grasp the barre using an overhand (pronated) grip and unlock it from the smith machine rack. Then let it hang directly in front of you as vos bras hang extended perpendiculaire à le sol and your torse. C''est votre position de départ.
4. While keeping the torse stationary, lift the barre as you Expirez, keeping the coudes close to the body and not doing any force with the forearm other than holding the poids. On the top contracted position, squeeze the back muscles and Maintenez la position 1 seconde.
5. Lentement, lower the poids again to the position de départ as you inspirez.
6. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Dos, Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Bent_Over_Row/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Calf Raise', 'Mollets', 'Machine', '1. Place a block or poids plate below the bar on the Smith machine. Set the bar to a position that best matches your height. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, step onto the plates with the balls of vos pieds and place the bar on the back of your épaules.
2. Take the bar with both hands facing forward. Rotate the bar to unrack it. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Raise your heels as high as possible by pushing off of the balls of vos pieds, flexing your calf at the top of the contraction. Your genous should remain extended. Maintenez la position 1 seconde before you start to go back down.
4. Return Lentement, to the position de départ as you Inspirez while lowering your heels.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Calf_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Close-Grip Bench Press', 'Triceps', 'Machine', '1. Place a flat banc underneath the smith machine. Place the barre at a height that you can reach when lying down and vos bras are almost fully extended. Once the poids you need is selected, Allongez-vous sur un banc plat. Using a close and pronated grip (paumes vers l''avant) that is around épaule width, unlock the bar from the rack and hold it straight over you with vos bras locked. C''est votre position de départ.
2. As you Inspirez, come down Lentement, until you feel the bar on your middle poitrine. Conseil : Make sure that as opposed to a regular banc press, you keep the coudes close to the torse en permanence in order to maximize triceps involvement.
3. Après une pause, bring the bar back to the position de départ as you Expirez and push the bar using your triceps muscles. Lock vos bras in the contracted position, Maintenez la position 1 seconde and then start coming down Lentement, again. Conseil : It should take at least twice as long to go down than to come up.
4. Répétez le mouvement for the prescribed amount of repetitions.
5. When you are done, lock the bar back in the rack.', 'Muscles secondaires : Pectoraux, Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Close-Grip_Bench_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Decline Press', 'Pectoraux', 'Machine', '1. Position a decline banc in the rack so that the bar will be above your poitrine. Load an appropriate poids and take your place on the banc.
2. Rotate the bar to unhook it from the rack and fully extend vos bras. votre dos should be slightly arched and your omoplates retracted. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Begin le mouvement by flexing vos bras, lowering the bar to your poitrine.
4. Pause briefly, and then extend vos bras to push the poids back to the position de départ.
5. After completing the desired number of repetitions, rotate the bar to rack the poids.', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules, Triceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Decline_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Hang Power Clean', 'Ischio-jambiers', 'Machine', '1. Position the bar at genou height and load it to an appropriate poids.
2. Take a pronated grip on the bar outside of épaule width and unhook the bar from the machine. vos bras should be fully extended with votre tête and poitrine up. Your coudes should be pointed out with your épaules back and down. Your hanches should be back, loading the tension into the ischio-jambiers. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Initate le mouvement by forcefully extending the hanches and genous, accelerating into the bar. Ensure that you keep vos bras straight during this part of the motion.
4. Upon full extension, rebend the hanches and genous to lower your receiving position.
5. Allow the arms to flex at this point, rotating the coudes around the bar to receive it on your épaules.
6. Extend through the hanches and genous to come to a standing position with the bar racked on your épaules to complete le mouvement.', 'Muscles secondaires : Fessiers, Bas du dos, Quadriceps, Épaules, Trapèzes. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Hang_Power_Clean/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Smith Machine Hip Raise', 'Abdominaux', 'Machine', '1. Position a banc in the rack and load the bar to an appropriate poids. Lie down on the banc, placing the bottom of vos pieds against the bar. Unlock the bar and extend vos jambes. You may need to use vos mains to assist you. For added stability grasp the sides of the Smith Machine. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Initiate le mouvement by rotating your pelvis, flexing your spine to raise your hanches off of the banc. Maintain a slight bend in the genous throughout the motion.
3. Après une pause, return the hanches to the banc.
4. Répétez for the desired number of repetitions.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Hip_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
